</ul>

<h2>Simple 7-Day Practice Plan</h2>
<ul>
<li>Day 1: Create a professional email and practise writing.</li>
<li>Day 2: Prepare a one-page CV.</li>
<li>Day 3: Create a document with headings and a table.</li>
<li>Day 4: Practise spreadsheet basics.</li>
<li>Day 5: Research five legitimate employers.</li>
<li>Day 6: Practise customer support responses.</li>
<li>Day 7: Review your work and update your CV.</li>
</ul>

<p>Remember: free courses can build skills, but employment is not guaranteed. Avoid paying unknown people for guaranteed jobs.</p>
